Description: SupraLINUX hardware driver manager
 A Kirigami application to detect, install and remove hardware drivers.
 Detection uses UbuntuDrivers and driver changes are delegated to the
 ubuntu-drivers command through pkexec, the same backend Ubuntu uses.
